# Without this, a Windows clone checks every file out with CRLF and the
# end_of_line = lf in .editorconfig becomes a lie.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.{bat,cmd,ps1} text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
go.sum linguist-generated
resources/public/js/*.min.js -text linguist-vendored
